            <img src="/hero/imgi_5_biodegradable_carry_bags-biodegradable_bags__compostable-products-ecofriendly-bags.-1.webp" alt="Customized Solutions" width="80" height="80" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; object-fit: contain; margin: 0 auto 15px; display: block;" />
            <h4 class="portfolio-title">Customized Solutions</h4>
